# master_suite — a primary bedroom with its ensuite bath and walk-in closet,
# read as one unit. Authored in local feet (SW corner 0,0). Stamp it with
# `use "parts/master_suite.barn" as m at <x>,<y>` and the ids become m.bed,
# m.bath, m.wic — reference them from the host (`door hall - m.bed`).
room bed: bedroom at 0,0 size 14 x 13
room bath: bathroom east-of bed align far size 8 x 7
room wic: closet east-of bed align near size 8 x 6

# the suite's internal circulation
door bed - bath width 2.5 offset 1 into bath hinge far
open bed - wic width 2.5

# an egress + light window on the bedroom (place the bed's west wall exterior)
window bed south casement width 4 offset 4 sill 2

# a smoke alarm in the sleeping room (IRC R314)
alarm smoke in bed

suite primary: bed bath wic
